od 13:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,13,2)\">Exod 13:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); on the other hand, <bdbheb>מַשִׁכִּיל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 9:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,14)\">Hos 9:14</ref> <highlight>miscarrying womb</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֹצֶר ר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 30:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,16)\">Prov 30:16</ref> <highlight>restraint</highlight> (i.e. barrenness) <highlight>of womb</highlight> (so <ref ref=\"Ps 107:36\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,36)\">Ps 107:36</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Perles')\">Perles<sup>Anal. 85</sup></lookup>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עָצַר בְּעַד ר</bdbheb> (of God) <ref ref=\"Gen 20:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,18)\">Gen 20:18</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>סָגַר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ר</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>בְּעַד</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,5)\">1Sam 1:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,6)\">1Sam 1:6</ref>, preventing childbirth. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>womb-man, woman-slave:</highlight> <bdbheb>רַחַם רַחֲמָתַיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 5:30\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,30)\">Judg 5:30</ref> <highlight>a woman, two women.</highlight> </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Hos 9:14", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 9, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Jer 20:17", "book": "JER", "chapter": 20, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Gen 20:18", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 20, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Judg 5:30", "b